#: kcmaccess.cpp:202
msgid "Audible Bell"
msgstr "Toonpingel"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:209
msgid "Use &system bell"
msgstr "&Systeempingel bruken"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:211
msgid "Us&e customized bell"
msgstr "&Egen Pingel bruken"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:213
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, the default system bell will be used. See the "
"\"System Bell\" control module for how to customize the system bell. "
"Normally, this is just a \"beep\"."
msgstr ""
"Wenn disse Optschoon aktiveert is, denn warrt de Standard Systeempingel "
"bruukt. Wenn Du ehr instellen wullt, denn kiek maal bi't Kuntrullzentrum bi "
"de \"Systeempingel\" na. Normaal is dat bloots en \"Piep\"."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:216
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to use a customized bell, playing a sound "
"file. If you do this, you will probably want to turn off the system bell."
"<p> Please note that on slow machines this may cause a \"lag\" between the "
"event causing the bell and the sound being played."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du disse Optschoon anmaakst, denn kannst Du en Klangdatei för de "
"Pingel instellen. Denn wullt Du woll ok de Systeempingel utmaken. "
"<p> Op langsame Reekner kann dat woll wesen, dat dor en lütt Tiet twischen "
"Begeefnis un Klang liggt."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:223
msgid "Sound &to play:"
msgstr "&Klang för't Afspelen:"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:228
msgid ""
"If the option \"Use customized bell\" is enabled, you can choose a sound "
"file here. Click \"Browse...\" to choose a sound file using the file dialog."
msgstr ""
"Wenn de Optschoon \"Egen Pingel bruken\" anmaakt is, denn kannst Du hier en "
"Datei utsöken. Klick op \"Stövern...\" wenn Du en Datei op dien Reekner "
"utsöken wullt."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:245
msgid "Visible Bell"
msgstr "Ogenpingel"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:251
msgid "&Use visible bell"
msgstr "Ogenpingel br&uken"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:253
msgid ""
"This option will turn on the \"visible bell\", i.e. a visible notification "
"shown every time that normally just a bell would occur. This is especially "
"useful for deaf people."
msgstr ""
"Disse Optschoon maakt de \"Ogenpingel\" an. T.B. bluckt de Schirm op, wenn "
"normaal de Pingel geiht. Dat is sünnerlich goot för Lüüd, de doof sünd."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:259
msgid "I&nvert screen"
msgstr "Klöre&n ümkehren"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:262
msgid "All screen colors will be inverted for the amount of time specified below."
msgstr ""
"All Klören op den Schirm schölen ümkehrt warrn. Dat is för en Tiet, de "
"Du nerrn fastleggst."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:264
msgid "F&lash screen"
msgstr "Schirm opb&lucken"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:266
msgid ""
"The screen will turn to a custom color for the amount of time specified "
"below."
msgstr ""
"De Schirm schall för'n fastleggt Tiet in en egen Klöör farvt warrn. De "
"Tiet kannst Du nerrn fastleggen."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:272
msgid "Click here to choose the color used for the \"flash screen\" visible bell."
msgstr ""
"Hier klicken, wenn Du de Klöör utsöken wullt, in de de Schirm bi't "
"Opblucken farvt warrt."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:279
msgid "Duration:"
msgstr "Wo lang:"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:280 kcmaccess.cpp:333 kcmaccess.cpp:351
msgid " msec"
msgstr " msek"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:282
msgid ""
"Here you can customize the duration of the \"visible bell\" effect being "
"shown."
msgstr "Hier kannst Du fastleggen, wo lang de \"Ogenpingel\" wiest warrt."

